---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Jonathan McCallum
permalink: /
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<h1 class="site-title">Jonathan McCallum</h1>
<hr class="rule-gold">
<p class="intro">Writing about faith, film, surfing, music and life.</p>

<p class="social">
  <a href="https://www.instagram.com/jonamccallum">Instagram</a>
  <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@jonamccallum">TikTok</a>
  <a href="https://x.com/jonamccallum">X</a>
  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Jonathanmccallum1">YouTube</a>
  <a href="https://www.threads.com/@jonamccallum">Threads</a>
  <a href="https://jonamccallum.substack.com">Substack</a>
</p>


<section class="featured" data-fade aria-labelledby="featured-heading">
  <h2 id="featured-heading">Newest writing</h2>
  {% set newestPosts = collections.publishedPosts | reverse %}
  {# The lead is the newest article that has a photo, so the big card
     at the top always has an image to catch the eye. An article
     without a photo still appears first in the row below. #}
  {% set latest = null %}
  {% for post in newestPosts %}
    {% if not latest and post.data.shareImage %}{% set latest = post %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% if not latest %}{% set latest = newestPosts[0] %}{% endif %}
  <a class="featured-lead" href="{{ latest.url }}">
    <span class="featured-lead__media">
      {% if latest.data.shareImage %}<img class="featured-lead__image" src="{{ latest.data.shareImage }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% else %}<span class="featured-lead__image featured-image--empty" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
    </span>
    <span class="featured-lead__body">
      <span class="featured-lead__eyebrow">Newest</span>
      <span class="featured-lead__title">{{ latest.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="meta">{{ latest.date | readableDate }}</span>
      <span class="excerpt">{{ latest.templateContent | excerpt(180) }}</span>
      <span class="featured-lead__read">Read <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </span>
  </a>
  <p class="featured-row__hint">More new writing — swipe for the next one <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></p>
  <ul class="featured-row" data-auto-carousel data-no-auto>
  {% set shown = 0 %}
  {% for post in newestPosts %}
    {% if post.url != latest.url and shown < 9 %}
    {% set shown = shown + 1 %}
    <li class="featured-card">
      <a class="featured-card__link" href="{{ post.url }}">
        {% if post.data.shareImage %}<img class="featured-image" src="{{ post.data.shareImage }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="featured-image featured-image--empty" aria-hidden="true"></div>{% endif %}
        <span class="featured-card__title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
        <span class="excerpt">{{ post.templateContent | excerpt(140) }}</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <div class="featured-controls">
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous article">‹</button>
    <div class="featured-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Newest articles"></div>
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next article">›</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="suggest-home" data-fade aria-labelledby="suggest-home-heading">
  <h2 id="suggest-home-heading">Who should I write about next?</h2>
  <p>Musicians and artists from all walks of life, including Jesus followers — tap a photo to suggest one.</p>
  <p class="row-hint">Swipe for more artists <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></p>
  <div class="suggest-carousel" role="list" aria-label="Musicians and artists you can suggest" data-progressive data-auto-carousel>
  {% for artist in suggest_carousel %}
    {% if loop.index <= 30 %}
    <button type="button" class="suggest-pick" role="listitem" data-artist="{{ artist.name }}" data-link="{{ artist.profile }}" title="Suggest {{ artist.name }}">
      <img src="{{ artist.img }}" alt="{{ artist.name }}" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
      <span class="suggest-pick__name">{{ artist.name }}</span>
      <span class="suggest-pick__note">{{ artist.note }}</span>
    </button>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="featured-controls">
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous artists">‹</button>
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next artists">›</button>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="suggest-carousel-data">{{ suggest_carousel | dump | replace("</", "<\\/") | safe }}</script>
  <p class="suggest-carousel__more"><a href="/suggest-an-artist/">Suggest someone else</a> — anyone you think I should hear.</p>
  <p class="suggest-optout">If you're featured here and would rather not be, please <a href="https://www.instagram.com/jonamccallum/">message Jonathan on Instagram</a> and he'll remove you.</p>
</section>

<section class="lang-taster" data-fade aria-labelledby="lang-taster-heading">
  <h2 id="lang-taster-heading">Have a listen in another language</h2>
  <p>I am still learning about music — all kinds of it, from all over the world. Have a listen in another language.</p>
  <p class="row-hint">Swipe for more languages <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></p>
  <div class="lang-taster__row" role="list" aria-label="Languages to listen in" data-auto-carousel>
  {% for lang in lang_taster %}
    <a class="lang-taster__card" role="listitem" href="{{ lang.url }}">
      {% if lang.img %}
      <img class="lang-taster__img" src="{{ lang.img }}" alt="{{ lang.artist }} — a {{ lang.name }} musician" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150">
      <span class="lang-taster__name">{{ lang.name }}</span>
      <span class="lang-taster__native" lang="{{ lang.code }}">{{ lang.native }}</span>
      {% else %}
      <span class="lang-taster__script" lang="{{ lang.code }}">{{ lang.native }}</span>
      <span class="lang-taster__name">{{ lang.name }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="featured-controls">
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous languages">‹</button>
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next languages">›</button>
  </div>
</section>

<p>The posts from the archive are being reviewed and will return here one by one.</p>

<section class="writing" data-fade aria-labelledby="writing-heading">
  <h2 id="writing-heading">Writing</h2>
  <p class="row-hint">More writing — swipe for the next one <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></p>
  <ul class="writing-row" data-auto-carousel>
  {% for post in collections.publishedPosts | reverse %}
    <li class="writing-card">
      {% if post.data.shareImage %}<img class="writing-image" src="{{ post.data.shareImage }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="writing-image writing-image--empty" aria-hidden="true"></div>{% endif %}
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <span class="meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
      <p class="excerpt">{{ post.templateContent | excerpt(140) }}</p>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <div class="featured-controls">
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous article">‹</button>
    <div class="featured-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="All articles"></div>
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next article">›</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="watch-section" data-fade aria-labelledby="watch-heading">
  <h2 id="watch-heading">Watch</h2>
  <p class="row-hint">More videos — swipe for the next one <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></p>
  <ul class="watch-row" data-auto-carousel data-no-auto>
  {% set shown = [] %}
  {% for post in collections.publishedPosts | reverse %}
    {% if post.data.source_video and shown | length < 6 %}
      {% set _ = shown.push(post) %}
    <li class="watch-card">
      <a href="{{ post.data.source_video }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <p class="watch-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">Read the article: {{ post.data.title }}</a></p>
    </li>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <div class="featured-controls">
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous video">‹</button>
    <div class="featured-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Videos"></div>
    <button type="button" class="featured-arrow" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next video">›</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="note-section" data-fade aria-labelledby="note-heading">
  <h2 id="note-heading">Leave a note</h2>
  <p>If something here spoke to you, leave a note for Jonathan. No name or email needed — notes are anonymous. If you would like a reply, the quickest way is a message on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/jonamccallum">Instagram</a> or <a href="https://www.threads.com/@jonamccallum">Threads</a>.</p>
  <p>This site is not for people under 18.</p>
  <form id="note-form">
    <label for="note-text">Your note</label>
    <textarea id="note-text" name="note" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Write a few words…" required></textarea>
    <button id="note-button" type="button">Leave the note</button>
  </form>
  <p id="note-result" aria-live="polite"></p>
</section>

<section class="ask-hero" data-fade aria-labelledby="ask-heading">
  <h2 id="ask-heading">Interact with Jonathan's writing</h2>
  <p>This is a conversation with Jonathan's writing, not with Jonathan himself. Ask anything about what he has written — every answer comes from his published posts, with a link to the post it came from.</p>
  <form id="ask-form">
    <label for="ask-question">Your question</label>
    <input id="ask-question" name="question" type="text" maxlength="500" placeholder="Ask about Narnia, surfing, Jesus…" required>
    <button id="ask-button" type="button">Ask</button>
  </form>
  <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Try asking">
    <button type="button" data-q="What has he written about Narnia?">Narnia</button>
    <button type="button" data-q="What does he say about surfing and Jesus?">Surfing and Jesus</button>
    <button type="button" data-q="Tell me about the poem “to sea”.">The poem “to sea”</button>
    <button type="button" data-q="What has he written about C. S. Lewis?">C. S. Lewis</button>
  </div>
  <div id="ask-answer" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <p class="ask-fallback"><a href="/search/">Or search the writing directly</a> — search always works, even when the chat is resting.</p>
  <p class="ai-note">An AI answers from Jonathan's writing only. It is not Jonathan, and it can get things wrong.</p>
</section>

<hr class="rule-gold">

{% include "get-involved.njk" %}
